\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces KVKK-Bench v0.1.2, public split, real-text tracks. Overall and the three name columns are F2 (\%); the name columns are per-track F2 (court-turkish, court-foreign, prose). Leak = share of gold characters left readable (lower is better). CIs: sentence-clustered bootstrap, 10,000 resamples. Size = what is downloaded to run (int8 ONNX plus rules for Katip; weights as loaded otherwise). Pages/s: Python on one Apple-silicon laptop; not an in-browser speed. Browser = run inside a web page via transformers.js/ONNX Runtime Web; a dash means not tested, not that it cannot run there. Numbers match the live leaderboard and the saved predictions.}}{4}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
